{
    "title": "Wegmans Meals 2GO",
    "description": "Order delicious, freshly prepared meals for delivery, carryout or curbside pickup. Choose your favorite restaurant foods like pizza, subs, sushi, soups, salads, mac & cheese, desserts, and more! Catering favorites are also available to make entertaining easy. Order beautifully prepared party platters, ready-to-heat entr\u00e9es, sub and sandwich trays, and more with Wegmans Catering 2GO. Meals and catering can be ordered ahead for takeout. Customize your favorite foods, pay, and redeem digital coupons right in the app!\r\n\r\nTake Full Advantage of Wegmans Meals 2GO & Catering 2GO:\r\n\u2022\tGet a variety of freshly prepared food to go \r\n\u2022\tOrder catering party trays to make entertaining easy\r\n\u2022\tChoose delivery, carryout or curbside pickup*\r\n\u2022\tSave time and skip the store and restaurant lines\r\n\u2022\tPreorder delicious food up to a week in advance!\r\n\u2022\tReorder meals from your order history\r\n\u2022\tSave on food delivery and takeout with digital coupons \r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re craving pizza for delivery, want sesame chicken takeout or need easy party catering, Wegmans Meals 2GO and Catering 2GO have you covered. All of our delicious food is made with our very best ingredients and ready for fast pickup or delivery!\r\n\r\n*Delivery and curbside pickup offered at select locations.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Order delicious, freshly prepared meals for delivery, carryout or curbside pickup. Choose your favorite restaurant foods like pizza, subs, sushi, soups, salads, mac &amp; cheese, desserts, and more! Catering favorites are also available to make entertaining easy. Order beautifully prepared party platters, ready-to-heat entr\u00e9es, sub and sandwich trays, and more with Wegmans Catering 2GO. Meals and catering can be ordered ahead for takeout. Customize your favorite foods, pay, and redeem digital coupons right in the app!<br><br>Take Full Advantage of Wegmans Meals 2GO &amp; Catering 2GO:<br>\u2022\tGet a variety of freshly prepared food to go <br>\u2022\tOrder catering party trays to make entertaining easy<br>\u2022\tChoose delivery, carryout or curbside pickup*<br>\u2022\tSave time and skip the store and restaurant lines<br>\u2022\tPreorder delicious food up to a week in advance!<br>\u2022\tReorder meals from your order history<br>\u2022\tSave on food delivery and takeout with digital coupons <br><br>If you\u2019re craving pizza for delivery, want sesame chicken takeout or need easy party catering, Wegmans Meals 2GO and Catering 2GO have you covered. All of our delicious food is made with our very best ingredients and ready for fast pickup or delivery!<br><br>*Delivery and curbside pickup offered at select locations.",
